    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cc_payload_t",
      "x": 76, "y": 548,
      "width": 608, "height": 104,
      "text": "payload 关键点：\n· input_ids = sample.tokens（整条轨迹 token id，而非文本）\n· max_new_tokens = 0（只做一次 prefix forward，不生成）\n· return_logprob = True + logprob_start_len = 0\n· temperature = args.rollout_temperature（只影响 student 采样）",
      "originalText": "payload 关键点：\n· input_ids = sample.tokens（整条轨迹 token id，而非文本）\n· max_new_tokens = 0（只做一次 prefix forward，不生成）\n· return_logprob = True + logprob_start_len = 0\n· temperature = args.rollout_temperature（只影响 student 采样）",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
