      "x": 798, "y": 554,
      "width": 604, "height": 56,
      "text": "reverse_kl = student_log_probs − teacher_log_probs\nKL 惩罚在 advantage 上在线计算，并存入 rollout_data 供日志（opd_reverse_kl）",
      "originalText": "reverse_kl = student_log_probs − teacher_log_probs\nKL 惩罚在 advantage 上在线计算，并存入 rollout_data 供日志（opd_reverse_kl）",
